{"unit_id":"hfyydd__dsh-cua#card-zh","repo":"hfyydd/dsh-cua","commit":"1c016a23818c57af195fffbe593d37c05b0afcc9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cua 是为 DeepSeek Harness 提供桌面计算机操作能力的插件，通过本机 cua-driver daemon 注册观察与操作工具。它可以列出窗口和应用、读取窗口无障碍元素树并附带截图，也能截取桌面或放大窗口局部。模型可按元素标记或像素坐标点击、输入文本、按键和滚动，并在操作后验证界面状态。适合需要让 DSH 查看并操作本机桌面应用的场景；使用前需启动 cua-driver daemon，并按平台安装或指定驱动。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:115","lib/tools.js:279","lib/tools.js:315","lib/tools.js:403"]}
{"unit_id":"hfyydd__dsh-cua#card-en","repo":"hfyydd/dsh-cua","commit":"1c016a23818c57af195fffbe593d37c05b0afcc9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cua adds tools to DeepSeek Harness through a local cua-driver daemon. It lists windows, reads accessibility controls with screenshots, captures the desktop, and lets the model click, type, press keys, scroll, and verify interface state. Use it to operate apps; the daemon must be running.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:115","lib/tools.js:279","lib/tools.js:315","lib/tools.js:403"]}
