{"unit_id":"hfyydd__dsh-cua#feature-window-observe","repo":"hfyydd/dsh-cua","commit":"1c016a23818c57af195fffbe593d37c05b0afcc9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cua 可列出顶层窗口与应用，并读取指定窗口的无障碍元素树及截图。通过 cua_list_windows、cua_list_apps 和 cua_window_state 获取目标信息与控件标记。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:283"]}
